{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_162_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，王三月，莒人伐我東鄙，圍邰。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"伐國不言圍邑，舉重也。取邑不書，圍，安足書也？","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"二、季孫宿帥師救邰，遂入鄆。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"遂，繼事也。受命而救邰，不受命而入鄆，惡季孫宿也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"三、夏，晉侯使士魴來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"四、秋，九月，吳子乘卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"五、冬，楚公子貞帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_162_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_162","textTraditional":"六、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}